      <p class="reality-check-description">
        Medical careers run on referrals. A college with strong alumni
                  in Bangalore hospitals = easier internship access, PG
                  guidance, job referrals. Start building your network early to
                  find seniors from your target college <em>before</em> you
                  join.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
