</p> </div> <h2>The "Plan B": What if you don't clear NEET?</h2> <p>
This is the reality nobody wants to talk about: over 15 lakh students write NEET for ~1 lakh MBBS seats. The odds are objectively against you. <strong>Failing NEET does not mean you failed at healthcare.</strong>
